  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When streaming VRChat, I want to only record the game, and not my VR Mirror (checking discord while streaming becomes a hastle when I don't want my chat seeing my DMs)\n\nUnfortunately I turn my head right a lot because my left eye only goes halfway, so most of what I do gets cut off because VRChat only records via the left eye. \n\nI believe there should be an option to have the display able to switch between Left/Right/Both eye dominance the same way SteamVR Mirror does",
